{
  "$comment": "P4.9K1 — the character-optimizer corpus over the committed character-generators-{main,mount}.db pair. Mira a2…01 (9 memories: 7 reinforced about herself, one rc=1, one about Nix), Nix a2…02 (none). Minted-but-baked ids: prompts Default 41c13f30-6ddb-8763-9fc8-eec33620c6ac / Terse 980a07f5-08d5-8d84-bf51-e279382fc493; scenarios Harbor d686e052-ebcd-868d-ac59-d85d1592b6c7 / Market 96763255-40bd-8fda-ab82-a356fedcb533; wardrobe Lantern Coat 19fa04df-a394-4c10-a3c8-864ac11bad29 / Brass Ring c9565dc5-31f6-4ace-8666-c1ac165382b2. `calls` is the scripted model answer per CALL INDEX (0 = the analysis, then one per sub-step in v4's order: general, Harbor, Market, Default, Terse, physical, wardrobe, properties, newSystemPrompts); a case that ends before the model has none. `embeddings` cans `generateEmbeddingForUser` by the exact query text; `embeddingThrows` makes it throw. The wall clock is frozen at `frozenNowMs` on both sides (the suggestions-file stamp + the memory-weight decay).",
